# This file ignores only build output, setup output, IDE files and optional user files.
# Personal patterns go in .git/info/exclude.

## Build output (images)
/.build/

## Setup output (`just setup`)
/.tools/
/.claude/skills/graphify/
/.claude/CLAUDE.md
/.claude/settings.json.graphify-bak

## Code graph (`just graphify update`)
/graphify-out/

## Serena: everything but the committed project config (index cache, memories, project.local.yml)
/.serena/*
!/.serena/project.yml

## Claude Code: personal settings and worktrees
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/

## IDE files
/.vscode/
/.idea/
